menu "IMU service optional processing"
config LUNAROS_IMU_FUSION
    bool "Enable optional six/nine-axis fusion and magnetic proximity processing"
    default n
    help
        Compile the independent portable fusion module and optional IMU service
        adapter. A product must explicitly configure the adapter before starting
        the service. No sensor, bus, product, or worker is selected automatically.
        Magnetic anomalies immediately disable magnetic heading feedback;
        stable fresh observations are required for gradual recovery.
endmenu
